# --- Dependencies & build output (rebuilt inside the container) ---
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
dist
**/dist
build
coverage
*.log

# --- Secrets: env is injected by docker compose, never baked into the image ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Training archive (174MB): only the runtime ONNX model in
# --- packages/ai-model/model/ is needed inside the image ---
apps/careerhub_production_model

# --- Non-build files: keep the context small so context upload is instant ---
.git
.github
docs
*.md
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.prettierrc
.editorconfig
.vscode
.idea
